commit cac030cd7e880567f600e2f029fab2c6fa0d2cc9
Author: Chance Strickland <hi@chance.dev>
Date:   Sun May 31 18:37:37 2026 -0700

    [Slot] add nested slottable support (#3729)

    Add a nested `Slottable` render-prop API
    (`<Slottable child={...}>{(child) => ...}</Slottable>`) so a slotted
    element can be wrapped while still merging Slot props and refs onto it,
    and remove the redundant internal `SlotClone` component.

    Misuse (no single slottable element) now throws a descriptive,
    owner-named error instead of the cryptic `React.Children.only` failure,
    while legitimate empty/conditional children still render nothing.

    Adds backwards-compatibility and edge-case tests plus SSR usage examples.

    Co-authored-by: Jenna Smith <175330+jjenzz@users.noreply.github.com>

